 932           * Function: post_mac_constraint
 933           * -----------------------------
 934           * Processes MAC learning constraint form submission.
 935           * Extracts selected ports, enable/disable state, and limit value.
 936           * Sets entry limit for each selected port using sal_l2_limitLearningCnt_set().
 937           * Unlimited limit is represented by MAX_LUT_ADDR_NUMBER.
 938           * Refreshes constraint page after applying settings.
